# The SPANISH service menu for iomoont, country 5 (Spain), captured in ONE menu entry.
#
# dmd/es/ has no service-menu tree at all, on the reading that F19 makes a Spanish menu
# capture impossible.  F19 is about menu EXIT: exiting queues 0xF8 (which reboots the
# Z80), and the rebooting Z80's own 0xFF state announcement wins the race against the
# real 0xF9 DIP reply, so sub_D5C3E accepts 0xFF and (0xFF AND 0x0E) - 2 decodes to
# country 7.  A walk that opens the menu ONCE and never exits and re-enters never runs
# that path, and the machine stays on its DIP country for the whole walk -- the store
# still reads country 5 at the end of this run, and the records render in Spanish.
#
# Requires scripts/keyscripts/iomoont-spain.cfg copied to <cfg dir>/iomoont.cfg, the
# same way dmd/es/ sets the country (a saved cfg, not a live DIP sequence).
#
# Navigation is F14's: 7 opens (0x3F), Right Shift selects (0x42), Left Shift scrolls
# (0x41), 1 goes back (0x40).  The walk alternates select and scroll to descend, and
# backs up to the root between branches -- never TEST, which would exit.
   40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
  900 mark attract
 1400 mark open-menu
 1410 tap 12 KEYCODE_7
 2200 mark svc-root
 2500 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 2620 mark svc-branch-1-enter
 2900 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 3020 mark svc-branch-1-item-1
 3250 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 3370 mark svc-branch-1-item-2
 3600 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 3720 mark svc-branch-1-item-3
 3950 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 4070 mark svc-branch-1-item-4
 4300 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 4420 mark svc-branch-1-item-5
 4650 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 4770 mark svc-branch-1-leaf
 5100 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 5220 mark svc-branch-1-back
 5450 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 5570 mark svc-back-to-root-1
 5850 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 5970 mark svc-root-scroll-1
 6150 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 6270 mark svc-branch-2-enter
 6550 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 6670 mark svc-branch-2-item-1
 6900 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 7020 mark svc-branch-2-item-2
 7250 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 7370 mark svc-branch-2-item-3
 7600 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 7720 mark svc-branch-2-item-4
 7950 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 8070 mark svc-branch-2-item-5
 8300 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 8420 mark svc-branch-2-leaf
 8750 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 8870 mark svc-branch-2-back
 9100 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 9220 mark svc-back-to-root-2
 9500 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 9620 mark svc-root-scroll-2
 9800 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 9920 mark svc-root-scroll-3
10100 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
10220 mark svc-branch-3-enter
10500 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
10620 mark svc-branch-3-item-1
10850 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
10970 mark svc-branch-3-item-2
11200 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
11320 mark svc-branch-3-item-3
11550 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
11670 mark svc-branch-3-item-4
11900 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
12020 mark svc-branch-3-item-5
12250 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
12370 mark svc-branch-3-leaf
12700 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
12820 mark svc-branch-3-back
13050 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
13170 mark svc-back-to-root-3
13450 mark end
